--------------------------------------------------------------------
A note on the HSK word lists
--------------------------------------------------------------------
The HSK levels themselves are a published standard from Hanban / the
Chinese Ministry of Education and are not claimed by this project. The
selection of the additional ~500 non-HSK words, and every pinyin and
English gloss written here, are this project's own work and fall under
the CC BY 4.0 license above.
